---
description: Cove development guidelines (canonical copy in .agents/rules/)
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow the Cove development guidelines. The canonical rules are in `.agents/rules/` — read the relevant files before writing code:

- @.agents/rules/00-project-overview.md — repo map, agent workflow, security model (always)
- @.agents/rules/01-shared.md — Makefile, DRY, docs, typing, tests (always)
- @.agents/rules/02-frontend.md — when touching `client-web/**`
- @.agents/rules/03-backend.md — when touching `backend/**`

Do not duplicate or diverge from those files; update them instead.
